        "Stygian Recurve Bow Stygian Wand Stygian Daggers Stygian Scepter Stygian Spear Stygian Defender (command) Stygian Aegis (motivation) Stygian Scythe Menzes' Ambition Menzes' Influence"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "The Foundry of Failed Creations",
      "level": 3,
      "paragraphs": [
        "Aegis of Aaaaarrrrrrggghhh (tactics) , , , or Ghostly Staff Nihil's Daggers"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Notes",
      "level": 2,
      "paragraphs": [
        "In the Gate of Anguish, heroes can be added to the party, but no henchmen can be added. The following Zaishen Quests take place here: The Stygian Underlords (Zaishen quest) - Stygian Veil The Stygian Lords (Zaishen quest) - Stygian Veil The Greater Darkness (Zaishen quest) - Ravenheart Gloom The Black Beast of Arrgh (Zaishen quest) - Foundry of Failed Creations Lord Jadoth (Zaishen quest) - City of Torc'qua"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Trivia",
      "level": 2,
      "paragraphs": [
        "Since the March 31, 2008 update, players no longer need the quest to spawn the end bosses of each area.",
        "Explorable areas in the Realm of Torment Depths of Madness • Domain of Anguish • Domain of Fear • Domain of Pain • Domain of Secrets • Heart of Abaddon • Nightfallen Garden • Nightfallen Jahai • Throne of Secrets Towns and outposts • Missions • Landmarks"
      ]
    }
