  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"noexcerpt\">\n<dl><dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Disambig_icon.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Disambig icon.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/19px-Disambig_icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"19\" height=\"16\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/29px-Disambig_icon.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/38px-Disambig_icon.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"225\" data-file-height=\"190\" /></a> <i>\"Doa\" redirects here. For the Prophecies title, see <a href=\"/wiki/Defender_of_Ascalon\" title=\"Defender of Ascalon\">Defender of Ascalon</a>.</i><br /></dd></dl></div>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt\">\n<dl><dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Disambig_icon.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Disambig icon.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/19px-Disambig_icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"19\" height=\"16\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/29px-Disambig_icon.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/38px-Disambig_icon.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"225\" data-file-height=\"190\" /></a> <i>This is an <a href=\"/wiki/Explorable_area\" title=\"Explorable area\">explorable area</a> entry.  For information on the <a href=\"/wiki/Outpost\" title=\"Outpost\">outpost</a>, see <a href=\"/wiki/Gate_of_Anguish\" title=\"Gate of Anguish\">Gate of Anguish</a>. For information on the <a href=\"/wiki/Mission\" title=\"Mission\">mission</a>, see <a href=\"/wiki/The_Ebony_Citadel_of_Mallyx\" title=\"The Ebony Citadel of Mallyx\">The Ebony Citadel of Mallyx</a>.   </i></dd></dl></div>\n<div id=\"Spoiler&#95;tag\" style=\"background: #F99; padding: 2px; margin: 3px 0px; border: 1px solid #F00; text-align: center\">\n<b><a href=\"/wiki/Template:Spoiler\" title=\"Template:Spoiler\">Spoiler alert</a>:</b> The following text contains spoilers relating to the story of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Guild_Wars_Nightfall\" title=\"Guild Wars Nightfall\">Guild Wars Nightfall</a></i>.</div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table style=\"margin: 0 0 0.5em 1em; border:1px solid silver; float:right; font-size:90%; text-align:left;\" cellpadding=\"5\" class=\"noexcerpt\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"font-size:110%; text-align:center; background-color:#BAE;\">Domain of Anguish\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Domain_of_Anguish.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Domain of Anguish.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/9/9e/Domain_of_Anguish.jpg/200px-Domain_of_Anguish.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/9/9e/Domain_of_Anguish.jpg/300px-Domain_of_Anguish.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/9/9e/Domain_of_Anguish.jpg/400px-Domain_of_Anguish.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"500\" data-file-height=\"375\" /></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE\"><a href=\"/wiki/Campaign\" title=\"Campaign\">Campaign</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Nightfall\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nightfall\">Nightfall</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Region\" title=\"Region\">Region</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Realm_of_Torment\" title=\"Realm of Torment\">Realm of Torment</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\">Type\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Explorable_area\" title=\"Explorable area\">Explorable area</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\">Exit(s)\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Gate_of_Anguish\" title=\"Gate of Anguish\">Gate of Anguish</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background-color:#BAE;\">Images\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Domain_of_Anguish/Map\" title=\"Domain of Anguish/Map\"><img alt=\"Domain of Anguish map.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/d/da/Domain_of_Anguish_map.jpg/200px-Domain_of_Anguish_map.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"202\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/d/da/Domain_of_Anguish_map.jpg/300px-Domain_of_Anguish_map.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/d/da/Domain_of_Anguish_map.jpg/400px-Domain_of_Anguish_map.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1000\" data-file-height=\"1009\" /></a><br /><small>Interactive map<br /><a href=\"/wiki/File:DomainofAnguishMap2.jpg\" title=\"File:DomainofAnguishMap2.jpg\">Non-interactive map</a></small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Eternal_Conqueror_of_the_Domain_of_Anguish.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Eternal Conqueror of the Domain of Anguish.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/4/47/Eternal_Conqueror_of_the_Domain_of_Anguish.jpg/200px-Eternal_Conqueror_of_the_Domain_of_Anguish.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"186\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/4/47/Eternal_Conqueror_of_the_Domain_of_Anguish.jpg/300px-Eternal_Conqueror_of_the_Domain_of_Anguish.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/4/47/Eternal_Conqueror_of_the_Domain_of_Anguish.jpg/400px-Eternal_Conqueror_of_the_Domain_of_Anguish.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"2460\" data-file-height=\"2283\" /></a><br /><small>Reward trophy in the <a href=\"/wiki/Hall_of_Monuments\" title=\"Hall of Monuments\">Hall of Monuments</a></small>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>The <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Domain of Anguish</a> is a special explorable area in <a href=\"/wiki/Guild_Wars_Nightfall\" title=\"Guild Wars Nightfall\">Guild Wars Nightfall</a>. It consists of four other explorable areas - <a href=\"/wiki/The_Foundry_of_Failed_Creations\" title=\"The Foundry of Failed Creations\">The Foundry of Failed Creations</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/City_of_Torc%27qua\" title=\"City of Torc&#39;qua\">City of Torc'qua</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Stygian_Veil\" title=\"Stygian Veil\">Stygian Veil</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Ravenheart_Gloom\" title=\"Ravenheart Gloom\">Ravenheart Gloom</a>. The only <a href=\"/wiki/Elite_Mission\" title=\"Elite Mission\">Elite Mission</a> in Nightfall takes place here, and thusly functions as a lobby for staging organizing parties with convenient access portals.\n</p><p>Containing valuable items, this area is regularly visited by players, though new players often get killed in a few seconds. Foes in this area are very strong and capable of demolishing every team not prepared for the dangers that await them. Only in the Domain of Anguish can players obtain <a href=\"/wiki/Tormented_weapon\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tormented weapon\">tormented weapons</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Primeval_armor#Hero_armor\" title=\"Primeval armor\">primeval hero armor</a>.\n</p><p>While on first sight Domain of Anguish does not contain an Elite Mission, it can only be unlocked by completing a <a href=\"/wiki/Quest\" title=\"Quest\">quest</a> first. The quest, <a href=\"/wiki/Mallyx_the_Unyielding_(quest)\" title=\"Mallyx the Unyielding (quest)\">Mallyx the Unyielding</a>, brings players through every corner of Domain of Anguish and ultimately brings the player to <a href=\"/wiki/The_Ebony_Citadel_of_Mallyx\" title=\"The Ebony Citadel of Mallyx\">The Ebony Citadel of Mallyx</a> which is the actual Elite Mission.\n</p><p>Initially, each of the four sections are sealed off from each other; once each section is completed, the entrance to the next counterclockwise section opens.  All four sections need not be completed at the same time (although doing so incrementally increases the reward from the chest upon completion of each section).  The <a href=\"/wiki/Quest_Log\" title=\"Quest Log\">Quest Log</a> will be updated to reflect completion of a section and the player can then enter another section directly from the <a href=\"/wiki/Gate_of_Anguish\" title=\"Gate of Anguish\">Gate of Anguish</a> at any later time.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Getting_there\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Getting there</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Foes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Foes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Unique_items\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Unique items</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#City_of_Torc&#39;qua\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">City of Torc'qua</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Ravenheart_Gloom\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Ravenheart Gloom</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Stygian_Veil\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Stygian Veil</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#The_Foundry_of_Failed_Creations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">The Foundry of Failed Creations</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Getting_there\">Getting there</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Domain_of_Anguish&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Getting there\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Can only be entered from the <a href=\"/wiki/Gate_of_Anguish\" title=\"Gate of Anguish\">Gate of Anguish</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Foes\">Foes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Domain_of_Anguish&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Foes\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The foes that are found here range from level 24 to 32 (depending on whether it is <a href=\"/wiki/Normal_mode\" title=\"Normal mode\">normal mode</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Hard_mode\" title=\"Hard mode\">hard mode</a>). Groups of foes are often very diverse, containing almost every <a href=\"/wiki/Profession\" title=\"Profession\">profession</a>. This makes it difficult to rely on certain builds and often teams are forced to create a balanced team. However, players are more and more exploring the weaknesses of the elite area and some can farm certain regions solo.\n</p><p>Unlike most of <a href=\"/wiki/Nightfall\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nightfall\">Nightfall</a>, the skills used by enemies are not limited to those available in the Nightfall Campaign. In addition, each of the 5 different armies have a different theme to the skills they use, that often interacts with the <a href=\"/wiki/Environment_Effect\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Environment Effect\">Environment Effect</a> for that area.\n</p>\n<ul><li>The <a href=\"/wiki/Margonites\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Margonites\">Margonites</a> focus on <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_denial\" title=\"Energy denial\">Energy denial</a> and doing damage when energy levels hit zero. <a href=\"/wiki/Repressive_Energy\" title=\"Repressive Energy\">Repressive Energy</a> exacerbates this problem, potentially triggering <a href=\"/wiki/Famine\" title=\"Famine\">Famine</a>'s effect very frequently.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/Torment_creature\" title=\"Torment creature\">Torment creatures</a> focus on inflicting <a href=\"/wiki/Health_Degeneration\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Health Degeneration\">Health Degeneration</a> and general shutdown with hexes and conditions. <a href=\"/wiki/Shroud_of_Darkness\" title=\"Shroud of Darkness\">Shroud of Darkness</a> makes killing these enemies slower, giving them time for their degeneration to do its work.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/Stygian_Veil\" title=\"Stygian Veil\">Stygian Veil</a> creatures tend to focus on pure numbers and physical damage, and <a href=\"/wiki/Demonic_Miasma\" title=\"Demonic Miasma\">Demonic Miasma</a> punishes you when trying to block their attacks.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/Titans\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Titans\">Titans</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Army\" title=\"Shadow Army\">Shadow Army</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Dhuum\" title=\"Dhuum\">Dhuum</a>'s army tend to focus on Area of Effect skills, forcing you to move more and take damage from <a href=\"/wiki/Enduring_Torment\" title=\"Enduring Torment\">Enduring Torment</a>.</li></ul>\n<p>In addition, every enemy in the Domain of Anguish uses the <a href=\"/wiki/Enraged\" title=\"Enraged\">Enraged</a> skill, increasing their damage the closer to death they are, forcing parties to kill targets quickly.\n</p><p>While there are Boss-like foes throughout the domain, there are no actual <a href=\"/wiki/Boss\" title=\"Boss\">Bosses</a> to provide <a href=\"/wiki/Morale_Boost\" title=\"Morale Boost\">Morale Boosts</a> or capture skills from.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Unique_items\">Unique items</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Domain_of_Anguish&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Unique items\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The Domain of Anguish is home to several <a href=\"/wiki/Unique_item\" title=\"Unique item\">unique items</a>, which are listed below.\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"City_of_Torc.27qua\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"City_of_Torc'qua\">City of Torc'qua</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Domain_of_Anguish&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: City of Torc&#039;qua\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Monk\"><img alt=\"Monk\" src=\"/images/f/f8/Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Shaunur%27s_Scepter\" title=\"Shaunur&#39;s Scepter\">Shaunur's Scepter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Paragon-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Paragon\"><img alt=\"Paragon\" src=\"/images/5/55/Paragon-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Bloodspear\" title=\"The Bloodspear\">The Bloodspear</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Paragon-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Paragon\"><img alt=\"Paragon\" src=\"/images/5/55/Paragon-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Turep%27s_Spear\" title=\"Turep&#39;s Spear\">Turep's Spear</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Ravenheart_Gloom\">Ravenheart Gloom</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Domain_of_Anguish&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Ravenheart Gloom\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Warrior\"><img alt=\"Warrior\" src=\"/images/3/3b/Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Aegis_of_Terror\" title=\"Aegis of Terror\">Aegis of Terror</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">(strength)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Monk\"><img alt=\"Monk\" src=\"/images/f/f8/Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a>, <a href=\"/wiki/File:Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Elementalist\"><img alt=\"Elementalist\" src=\"/images/a/ab/Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a>, <a href=\"/wiki/File:Necromancer-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Necromancer\"><img alt=\"Necromancer\" src=\"/images/7/7b/Necromancer-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a>, <a href=\"/wiki/File:Mesmer-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Mesmer\"><img alt=\"Mesmer\" src=\"/images/f/fb/Mesmer-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> or <a href=\"/wiki/File:Ritualist-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Ritualist\"><img alt=\"Ritualist\" src=\"/images/8/81/Ritualist-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Staff_(unique)\" title=\"Shadow Staff (unique)\">Shadow Staff</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dervish-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Dervish\"><img alt=\"Dervish\" src=\"/images/3/3e/Dervish-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Scythe_of_Corruption\" title=\"Scythe of Corruption\">Scythe of Corruption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Elementalist\"><img alt=\"Elementalist\" src=\"/images/a/ab/Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Menzes%27_Ambition\" title=\"Menzes&#39; Ambition\">Menzes' Ambition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Necromancer-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Necromancer\"><img alt=\"Necromancer\" src=\"/images/7/7b/Necromancer-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Menzes%27_Influence\" title=\"Menzes&#39; Influence\">Menzes' Influence</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Stygian_Veil\">Stygian Veil</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Domain_of_Anguish&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Stygian Veil\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ranger-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Ranger\"><img alt=\"Ranger\" src=\"/images/d/dc/Ranger-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Stygian_Recurve_Bow\" title=\"Stygian Recurve Bow\">Stygian Recurve Bow</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Mesmer-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Mesmer\"><img alt=\"Mesmer\" src=\"/images/f/fb/Mesmer-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Stygian_Wand\" title=\"Stygian Wand\">Stygian Wand</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Assassin-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Assassin\"><img alt=\"Assassin\" src=\"/images/5/5f/Assassin-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Stygian_Daggers\" title=\"Stygian Daggers\">Stygian Daggers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ritualist-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Ritualist\"><img alt=\"Ritualist\" src=\"/images/8/81/Ritualist-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Stygian_Scepter\" title=\"Stygian Scepter\">Stygian Scepter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Paragon-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Paragon\"><img alt=\"Paragon\" src=\"/images/5/55/Paragon-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Stygian_Spear\" title=\"Stygian Spear\">Stygian Spear</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Paragon-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Paragon\"><img alt=\"Paragon\" src=\"/images/5/55/Paragon-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Stygian_Defender\" title=\"Stygian Defender\">Stygian Defender</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Command\" title=\"Command\">(command)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Paragon-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Paragon\"><img alt=\"Paragon\" src=\"/images/5/55/Paragon-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Stygian_Aegis\" title=\"Stygian Aegis\">Stygian Aegis</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Motivation\" title=\"Motivation\">(motivation)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dervish-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Dervish\"><img alt=\"Dervish\" src=\"/images/3/3e/Dervish-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Stygian_Scythe\" title=\"Stygian Scythe\">Stygian Scythe</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Elementalist\"><img alt=\"Elementalist\" src=\"/images/a/ab/Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Menzes%27_Ambition\" title=\"Menzes&#39; Ambition\">Menzes' Ambition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Necromancer-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Necromancer\"><img alt=\"Necromancer\" src=\"/images/7/7b/Necromancer-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Menzes%27_Influence\" title=\"Menzes&#39; Influence\">Menzes' Influence</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"The_Foundry_of_Failed_Creations\">The Foundry of Failed Creations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Domain_of_Anguish&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: The Foundry of Failed Creations\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Warrior\"><img alt=\"Warrior\" src=\"/images/3/3b/Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Aegis_of_Aaaaarrrrrrggghhh\" title=\"Aegis of Aaaaarrrrrrggghhh\">Aegis of Aaaaarrrrrrggghhh</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Tactics\" title=\"Tactics\">(tactics)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Monk\"><img alt=\"Monk\" src=\"/images/f/f8/Monk-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a>, <a href=\"/wiki/File:Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Elementalist\"><img alt=\"Elementalist\" src=\"/images/a/ab/Elementalist-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a>, <a href=\"/wiki/File:Necromancer-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Necromancer\"><img alt=\"Necromancer\" src=\"/images/7/7b/Necromancer-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a>, <a href=\"/wiki/File:Mesmer-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Mesmer\"><img alt=\"Mesmer\" src=\"/images/f/fb/Mesmer-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> or <a href=\"/wiki/File:Ritualist-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Ritualist\"><img alt=\"Ritualist\" src=\"/images/8/81/Ritualist-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ghostly_Staff_(unique)\" title=\"Ghostly Staff (unique)\">Ghostly Staff</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Assassin-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Assassin\"><img alt=\"Assassin\" src=\"/images/5/5f/Assassin-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Nihil%27s_Daggers\" title=\"Nihil&#39;s Daggers\">Nihil's Daggers</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Domain_of_Anguish&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Notes\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>In the Gate of Anguish, <a href=\"/wiki/Hero\" title=\"Hero\">heroes</a> can be added to the <a href=\"/wiki/Party\" title=\"Party\">party</a>, but no <a href=\"/wiki/Henchman\" title=\"Henchman\">henchmen</a> can be added.</li>\n<li>The following <a href=\"/wiki/Zaishen_Quest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Zaishen Quest\">Zaishen Quests</a> take place here:\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Stygian_Underlords_(Zaishen_quest)\" title=\"The Stygian Underlords (Zaishen quest)\">The Stygian Underlords (Zaishen quest)</a> - Stygian Veil</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Stygian_Lords_(Zaishen_quest)\" title=\"The Stygian Lords (Zaishen quest)\">The Stygian Lords (Zaishen quest)</a> - Stygian Veil</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Greater_Darkness_(Zaishen_quest)\" title=\"The Greater Darkness (Zaishen quest)\">The Greater Darkness (Zaishen quest)</a> - Ravenheart Gloom</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Black_Beast_of_Arrgh_(Zaishen_quest)\" title=\"The Black Beast of Arrgh (Zaishen quest)\">The Black Beast of Arrgh (Zaishen quest)</a> - Foundry of Failed Creations</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Lord_Jadoth_(Zaishen_quest)\" title=\"Lord Jadoth (Zaishen quest)\">Lord Jadoth (Zaishen quest)</a> - City of Torc'qua</li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Domain_of_Anguish&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Trivia\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Since the <a href=\"/wiki/Game_updates/20080331\" title=\"Game updates/20080331\">March 31, 2008 update</a>, players no longer need <a href=\"/wiki/Mallyx_the_Unyielding_(quest)\" title=\"Mallyx the Unyielding (quest)\">the quest</a> to <a href=\"/wiki/Spawn\" title=\"Spawn\">spawn</a> the end bosses of each area.</li></ul>\n<hr style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em; clear:both;\" />\n<table style=\"border:1px solid silver; font-size:90%; width:90%; text-align:center; clear:both;\" align=\"center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"background:#BAE; font-size:110%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Realm_of_Torment#Explorable_areas\" title=\"Realm of Torment\">Explorable areas in the Realm of Torment</a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Depths_of_Madness\" title=\"Depths of Madness\">Depths of Madness</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Domain of Anguish</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Domain_of_Fear\" title=\"Domain of Fear\">Domain of Fear</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a h